+// Model and commands for the native product menu. Firefox owns what the menu
+// offers and its browser commands; native code renders this bounded model as a
+// cascading MenuFlyout and reports an opaque item id back. The native editor
+// and Windows package-update host use Firefox's labels but handle their own UI.
